Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

This project builds on two projects by Vercel Labs, both licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0, and used unmodified:

- agent-desktop (https://github.com/vercel-labs/agent-desktop), a git submodule in
  vendor/agent-desktop. The engine (crates/engine) compiles its own sources, unmodified, with
  this project's adapter; the installer copies its agent-desktop and agent-desktop-windows
  skills unmodified.
- agent-browser (https://github.com/vercel-labs/agent-browser), a git submodule in
  vendor/agent-browser, installed for users from its official npm package, unmodified; the
  installer copies its agent-browser skill unmodified.

Agent Record Adapter is not the official agent-desktop or agent-browser and is not endorsed by
Vercel. "agent-desktop", "agent-browser" and "Vercel" are names of their owners.

Parts of this project were first written in the desktop-recorder-mcp fork of agent-desktop
(https://github.com/giancarlo92/agent-desktop, branch feat/record) by the same author, and moved
here: the background mode, the recorder, secrets, the stroke, menu, click-at and navigate
commands, the Desktop Recorder app (apps/recorder), the installer (packages/agent-record-adapter)
and the desktop-recording, recording-to-script and script-repair skills. Code in this project
that was copied or adapted from agent-desktop's sources carries a notice saying so.

Desktop Recorder uses icons from Tabler Icons (https://tabler.io/icons), MIT License; the licence
is in apps/recorder/assets/icons/LICENSE-tabler-icons.txt.

THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.txt lists the licences of the Rust crates the programs are built with.
